", "author": {"steamid": "76561199181677642", "personaname": "ac unit", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199181677642/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 539, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 539, "last_played": 1713659295, "avatar": "ffd961a2b548e65566f0202bcb3abd2fb1ef949e"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game \r\nbad part of it no piloting the titan", "timestamp_created": 1713739951, "timestamp_updated": 1713739951, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.529411792755126953", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "163343238", "author": {"steamid": "76561198033870059", "personaname": "𒈞Ƒiͥñnͣaͫ🅽🆄🆃", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198033870059/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 403, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 403, "last_played": 1713731133, "avatar": "5db2c5c979acbc34a77737772938734b5f29ae1f"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a good game. Mechanics are button masher, but its meant to be a power trip kinda game. Music is meh. Fun for what it is, which is being a big space marine cutting down aliens and heretics. \n\nI want so desperately to recommend it. \n\nBut that price.\n\nI know I bought this on sale, because I would have balked at that price otherwise. \n\nThe game was made in 2011. TotalBiscuit (RIP) reviewed it in a \"WTF Is\" video. Sega didn't even originally publish it. Sega owns the game because they bought the rights (And Relic) at a liquidation sale. To make it worse, the game is also broken. It crashes on launch. In the community discussion there is a post where they mention downloading a dll, then putting it in the game folder. This fixed the issue. For the price, it shouldn't be a thing. I am between wanting to blame the publisher for being greedy, or send some emails asking if someone at Sega fat fingered in a $60.\n\nIf the price were, like, $20 at most, I'd recommend Warhammer fans pick it up, in anticipation of the sequel coming soon.\n\nFor $60? I recommend saving your money until the sequel comes out, then buy that. Or buying Doom Eternal. Or buying a used Xbox 360 and Gears of War 3. Former is the evolution on this style of game, and the latter is where Space Marine borrowed from.\n\n(If they have updated the price since this review, its a tenuous recommend)", "timestamp_created": 1713733344, "timestamp_updated": 1713733344, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 33, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.677698135375976562", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 16, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "163331783", "author": {"steamid": "76561199230111049", "personaname": "Cheif20top", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199230111049/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 4268, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1231, "deck_playtime_at_review": 12, "last_played": 1725340211, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Compared to modern day games the story is really well done, and the game play is solid.", "timestamp_created": 1713722405, "timestamp_updated": 1713722405, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false